WEBVTT

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:17.910
anata ni tazuneraretara watashi

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:17.910
あなたに尋ねられたら私

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:17.910
When you come visit me

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:23.650
nikkori hohoemu deshou

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:23.650
にっこり微笑むでしょう

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:23.650
I'll probably break into a big smile

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:29.630
umaku ienai kedo subete ga

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:29.630
うまく言えないけどすべてが

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:29.630
I can't really put it into words

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:35.710
totemo totemo kageyaitemasu

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:35.710
とてもとても輝いてます

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:35.710
but everything is shining oh so bright

00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:47.600
kitto ima goro minna atsumattemasu

00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:47.600
きっと今頃皆集まってます

00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:47.600
I bet everyone is together right about now

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:53.330
sore wa sawagashikute

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:53.330
それは騒がしくて

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:53.330
It may get a little rowdy

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:58.810
demo itoshii

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:58.810
でもいとしい

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:58.810
but I wouldn't have it any other way

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:04.810
tonde ikimasu itsumo no tokoro e

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:04.810
飛んでいきますいつもの所へ

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:04.810
Let's fly away to our usual place

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:10.790
taiyou takaku ashita mo hare desu

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:10.790
太陽高く明日も晴れです

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:10.790
Tomorrow will be clear with the sun in the sky

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:16.590
moshi mo sukoshi sabishiku nattemo

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:16.590
もしも少し寂しくなっても

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:16.590
Even if you get a little lonely

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:21.100
daijoubu chanto miteimasu

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:21.100
大丈夫ちゃんと見ています

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:21.100
it's okay, I'll be watching

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:25.600
koko de

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:25.600
ここで

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:25.600
right here

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:45.560
The Hiryu Dark Martial Arts Festival?

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:50.260
Yep, it's an annual Hiryu specialty where we can start fights.

00:01:50.260 --> 00:01:51.600
No questions asked and no recriminations.

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:53.670
How barbaric...

00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:59.640
C'mon, Mahoro, rowdy festivals ain't all that unusual.

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:02.060
It's the one day where you can get your body moving...

00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:03.880
...and blow off all the steam that's built up during the day!

00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:09.750
In this day and age, it's hard to believe that there were ever festivals like that.

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:12.910
I... ain't talkin' about the past.

00:02:23.020 --> 00:02:26.590
Actually, Mahoro, tonight's the night.

00:02:26.890 --> 00:02:29.340
The night of the "Hiryu Dark Martial Arts Festival"!

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:44.060
<b>Episode 7</b>

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:44.060
<b>Don't Ever Come Back Again!</b>

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:49.860
I'm home!

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:52.610
Welcome back, Mahoro.

00:02:54.850 --> 00:02:56.840
What are you doing?

00:02:57.250 --> 00:02:58.370
Warmup exercises.

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:03.300
There's a festival tonight, you see. It's called the Hiryu Dark Martial Arts Festival.

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:03.240
<b>Gulp!</b>

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:03.280
<b>Gulp!</b>

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:03.320
<b>Gulp!</b>

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:03.370
<b>Gulp!</b>

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:05.410
<b>Gulp!</b>

00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:04.910
I forbid it!

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:11.360
Oh, it'll be fine. There are rules now, so there's hardly any danger at all.

00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:13.260
I said no, and I mean it!

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:13.630
<b></b>Afraid...

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:13.750
<b></b>Afraid...

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:33.020
<b></b>Afraid...

00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:17.990
As a maid in the Misato household, I can in no way condone your participation...

00:03:17.990 --> 00:03:21.790
...in a festival where there is a possibility that you will come to harm!

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:28.560
I've always admired how Suguru only uses violence as a last resort.

00:03:28.910 --> 00:03:33.010
Why in the world would he deliberately want to attend such a barbaric festival?

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:34.590
I can't go, no matter what?

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:36.220
No matter what!

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:43.010
In that case, maybe I'll just spend the night studying for entrance exams this year.

00:03:43.850 --> 00:03:45.760
Yes, that's an excellent idea!

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:45.870
<b>Whew...</b>

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:48.320
Well, I'll be in my room.

00:03:48.690 --> 00:03:50.680
I'll bring you your dinner later.

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:51.290
Sure.

00:03:57.760 --> 00:04:02.250
Time for dinner, Suguru! I made udon noodles stewed in miso...

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:08.820
Suguru?

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:24.100
<b>Mahoro, I'm sorry.</b>

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:24.100
<b>But we have a saying here.</b>

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:24.100
<b>A Hiryu man who hides at home on</b>

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:24.100
<b>midwinter's night is to be branded</b>

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:24.100
<b>a coward...             So please...</b>

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:24.100
<b>try to understand.</b>

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:24.100
<b>I'll eat dinner when I get back</b>

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:11.130
"Mahoro, I'm sorry."

00:04:11.820 --> 00:04:14.020
"But we have a saying here."

00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:22.350
"A Hiryu man who hides at home on midwinter's night is to be branded a coward."

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:23.930
"So please..."

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:25.770
"...try to understand."

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:27.340
Big sister?

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:28.460
"P.S. I'll eat dinner when I get back."

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:31.920
He snuck out!

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:49.090
This is so dangerous!

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:53.570
We have to locate Suguru and take him into protective custody at once!

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:55.870
Oh, hey, you two!

00:04:57.210 --> 00:04:59.000
Greengrocer! Fishmonger!

00:04:59.600 --> 00:05:01.800
Are you two fighting in the festival, too, Mahoro?

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:04.560
No, we're looking for Suguru, so we...

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:09.150
Hey, aren't you carrying anything? Hey, Butcher, lend the little lady something.

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:09.980
Sure thing.

00:05:10.380 --> 00:05:12.960
Hiryu Dark Martial Arts Festival Rule #1:

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:18.370
"All fighting must be conducted with municipally designated foam weapons."

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:20.750
Hey, you're forgetting something important.

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:23.610
Rule #2: "Participants are to wear a flower on their head,

00:05:23.610 --> 00:05:26.260
...and if this flower's stem is snapped, said person is disqualified."

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:28.030
Um, have you seen Suguru?

00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:30.180
Suguru? Nah, I ain't seen him.

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:32.980
At any rate, the goal is to reach the Hiryu Shrine.

00:05:33.340 --> 00:05:38.300
Rule #3: "Participants in the festival must be on shrine grounds...

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:41.280
...by the time the Hiryu Shrine bell tolls midnight."

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:44.700
The Hiryu Shrine? Thank you.

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:46.760
There's one more rule...

00:05:46.890 --> 00:05:47.270
Yes?

00:05:47.670 --> 00:05:52.620
Rule #4: "People who meet on the street during the festival must fight."

00:05:53.150 --> 00:05:54.970
Huh? But that would mean...

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:18.160
He's good!

00:06:21.030 --> 00:06:22.990
Magnificent! Just magnificent!

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:27.360
This fight is violent, and yet peaceful!

00:06:33.570 --> 00:06:34.110
Sera?

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:35.600
I came.

00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:38.740
What's the meaning of this? This place is dangerous.

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:43.690
It's just that you've seemed so happy since you became a teacher, Ryuga.

00:06:44.260 --> 00:06:46.180
Why shouldn't I be interested?

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:53.930
Nevertheless, I'm a combat android, so I'll be fine even if there are unforeseen accidents,

00:06:54.650 --> 00:06:56.850
...but you weren't constructed that way, Sera.

00:06:57.290 --> 00:06:57.940
But...

00:06:58.740 --> 00:07:01.790
But you're always planetside, and you always come home late.

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:04.610
I'm always up there all by myself...

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:07.800
Do you like cold dinners that much, Ryuga?

00:07:08.130 --> 00:07:09.470
S-Sera?

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:14.380
Gotcha!

00:07:14.610 --> 00:07:16.370
I did it! I did it! I did it!

00:07:17.180 --> 00:07:18.000
That was mean.

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:23.170
Thanks for taking out that tough guy for us, little lady.

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:27.950
Now we'll step in and have ourselves a little fun.

00:07:41.930 --> 00:07:43.210
Thank you, Ryuga.

00:07:43.740 --> 00:07:44.270
It was nothing.

00:07:44.890 --> 00:07:46.830
You lost your flower, so you're disqualified!

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:48.190
Play fair, old man!

00:07:48.930 --> 00:07:52.120
Who are you calling an old man?! I'm only three!

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:53.970
And Sera here is four.

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:55.670
I'm his older sister.

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:57.200
What's up with THEM?

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:02.910
What the...

00:08:02.910 --> 00:08:04.100
Now, Greengrocer!

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:08.420
Your skills are indeed strong.

00:08:08.680 --> 00:08:11.960
I always knew you were something special, Mahoro.

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:15.530
You live up to our expectations. No, you exceed them!

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:17.020
We're thrilled.

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:20.270
I hate to fight and run, but I'm in a hurry.

00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:24.720
If you refuse to clear the way, then all of you come at me at once!

00:08:25.390 --> 00:08:28.700
Still, we're Hiryu natives, born and bred.

00:08:28.850 --> 00:08:30.770
We can't possibly lose.

00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:31.780
Let's do it!

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:34.790
Jet Stream!

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:39.590
Use me as a springboard!

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:43.690
W-We lost...

00:08:44.760 --> 00:08:46.420
Good fight, though.

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:48.190
Yeah, I got no regrets.

00:08:48.730 --> 00:08:51.050
You were excellent rivals, everyone.

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:53.520
Mahoro...

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:58.950
Geez, here comes Greengrocer's waterworks again.

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:00.560
He's hopeless.

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:03.750
Big sister... What about Suguru?

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:10.090
Are you ready?

00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:12.900
I'm ready. Do you have your weapon?

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:14.670
I don't need one.

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:25.560
What the...? The old bait-and-switch?

00:09:26.910 --> 00:09:28.070
You're wide open!

00:09:34.330 --> 00:09:36.470
You're getting pretty good, Suguru.

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:39.550
Only because you've been training me every year.

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:42.030
Make it all the way to the shrine grounds this year!

00:09:42.750 --> 00:09:43.820
That's the idea.

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:48.250
Hey, that road's the long way. Cutting through the field to the east would...

00:09:48.530 --> 00:09:52.540
That's how I lost last year, so everyone's using that shortcut.

00:09:52.540 --> 00:09:56.820
Oh, I see. There are too many people to fight, so you'd run out of time.

00:09:57.010 --> 00:09:58.630
Okay, I'll see you later.

00:09:58.630 --> 00:09:59.350
Hang in there!

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:04.720
Just as I thought, cutting through the eastern fields was a shortcut.

00:10:05.020 --> 00:10:08.510
But can we make it through here?

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:12.680
We have no choice. Our only option is a frontal assault!

00:10:13.850 --> 00:10:15.440
Let's do it, Minawa!

00:10:18.890 --> 00:10:20.440
All forces, advance!

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:22.420
Commence attack!

00:10:50.900 --> 00:10:54.730
When it's all said and done, girls are at a disadvantage in situations like this.

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:58.140
We have to use teamwork to fight our way through.

00:10:58.370 --> 00:11:00.690
But why am I on point?

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:04.680
Because you're the oldest daughter of the Todoroki Dojo, that's why.

00:11:05.070 --> 00:11:08.450
And of the three of us, you're the tallest.

00:11:08.950 --> 00:11:11.220
Is that really the only reason?

00:11:11.550 --> 00:11:13.410
That's all, that's all!

00:11:11.550 --> 00:11:13.410
That's all, that's all!

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:16.640
That's all, that's all...

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:16.640
That's all, that's all...

00:11:16.720 --> 00:11:18.650
That's all, that's all...

00:11:16.720 --> 00:11:18.650
That's all, that's all...

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:20.340
That's all, that's all...

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:20.340
That's all, that's all...

00:11:34.190 --> 00:11:38.530
You weren't trying to get me with a sneak attack, were you?

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:41.420
W-We just tripped on a rock.

00:11:41.780 --> 00:11:45.580
We're all on the same team, right? Would we try anything that dirty?

00:11:45.580 --> 00:11:46.810
I wonder.

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:56.570
I knew it! You had this in mind all along!

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:58.630
You bunch of backstabbers!

00:11:58.630 --> 00:12:00.280
Look who's talking!

00:12:00.680 --> 00:12:05.620
Oh, will there ever be a time when people will be able to trust one another?

00:12:06.260 --> 00:12:07.740
Like you're one to talk!

00:12:06.260 --> 00:12:07.740
Like you're one to talk!

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:12.650
Well, this is a bit of a problem. I never expected to run into you here.

00:12:12.890 --> 00:12:16.770
But the rule is that once we meet, we have to fight, right?

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:20.710
My skill with the sword is greater, and it has the longer reach.

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:24.380
We'll just have to put that to the test.

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:31.020
We see that you are indeed formidable opponents,

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:33.960
...but we won't allow you to take one step past us!

00:12:36.030 --> 00:12:37.830
As the man said, "Come closer at your own peril!"

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:40.180
En garde!

00:12:45.370 --> 00:12:47.160
Big sister, that was amazing!

00:12:48.960 --> 00:12:50.360
Face us, too!

00:12:50.610 --> 00:12:52.170
Huh? You're kidding!

00:12:58.140 --> 00:12:59.860
I-I'm sorry!

00:13:00.180 --> 00:13:01.080
I'm sorry!

00:13:01.990 --> 00:13:02.800
How did she...

00:13:02.290 --> 00:13:03.450
I'm sorry!

00:13:04.830 --> 00:13:06.880
I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:08.650
Big Sister!

00:13:07.900 --> 00:13:09.270
Is that... Drunken Boxing?

00:13:09.960 --> 00:13:11.320
No, Apology Fu?

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:13.580
As they say, "Don't ever come back again!"

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:15.120
S-She's tough!

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:15.010
I'm sorry!

00:13:15.120 --> 00:13:17.290
And she's a samurai movie nut, too!

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:24.490
Oh, no! The bell!

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:27.910
lt's almost midnight! We have to hurry!

00:13:28.020 --> 00:13:29.170
C-Coming!

00:13:31.070 --> 00:13:34.450
Mahoro, you forget your initial objective, didn't you?

00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:37.300
You HAVE, haven't you?

00:13:42.610 --> 00:13:44.600
I see your skills have improved, Suguru.

00:13:45.520 --> 00:13:48.090
Or is it that yours have grown weak, Kawahara?

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:49.140
How dare you!

00:13:57.360 --> 00:13:57.830
Who's there?!

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:02.120
I missed, huh? That's too bad.

00:14:02.120 --> 00:14:02.870
Hamaji!

00:14:02.870 --> 00:14:04.310
That was dirty!

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:06.530
You've been hiding in the forest the whole time, HAVEN'T you?!

00:14:06.850 --> 00:14:09.510
Preserving your strength is a legitimate strategy!

00:14:09.520 --> 00:14:12.580
C'mon, c'mon, c'mon!

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:16.800
Look, they're going at it!

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:20.170
You can do it, Suguru!

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:23.050
Suguru looks so dashing and gallant when he's fighting!

00:14:23.330 --> 00:14:24.850
Suguru, fight!

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:25.840
<b>Grrr</b>

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:25.840
<b>Grrr</b>

00:14:26.910 --> 00:14:29.010
I think we both know who needs to go first.

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:29.530
Yep.

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:32.310
C'mon, you two! Don't be like that!

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:33.730
Don't waste your breath!

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:35.120
You missed your chance!

00:14:40.050 --> 00:14:41.140
What a gust!

00:14:53.510 --> 00:14:55.220
We were bested by Suguru...

00:14:55.400 --> 00:14:57.710
...yet my youth knows no regrets.

00:15:00.510 --> 00:15:01.340
I did it!

00:15:01.620 --> 00:15:04.170
This will be the first time in my life that I made it to the shrine grounds!

00:15:04.510 --> 00:15:07.510
This gives me the right to challenge last year's winner...

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:10.230
Last year's winner?

00:15:13.820 --> 00:15:15.750
Oh, no!

00:15:16.770 --> 00:15:19.760
<i>Southern barbarian technique...!</i>

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:32.450
What a gruesome scene this is...

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:36.500
"A heartrending sound! Underneath the helmet, the cricket."

00:15:37.140 --> 00:15:41.390
As they say, "The poem is out of season, but it cannot be helped."

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:03.490
lt's her!

00:16:10.680 --> 00:16:13.140
So, Ms. Shikijo is the final boss, huh?

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:16.940
Allow me to extend my compliments on managing to make it this far.

00:16:17.190 --> 00:16:18.010
But nevertheless...

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:23.300
I, champion for two years running, will put an end to you right here and now!

00:16:24.060 --> 00:16:28.100
We have dispatched many warriors to reach this, the site of the final showdown.

00:16:28.820 --> 00:16:30.680
We will not turn back, not now!

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:32.710
Let's go, Minawa!

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:33.890
R-Right!

00:16:38.780 --> 00:16:39.960
I'b zorry...

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:43.910
All right, then... I challenge you!

00:16:44.160 --> 00:16:44.860
I accept!

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:50.480
W-Why are you stripping?!

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:54.560
The less I wear, the stronger I become...

00:16:54.960 --> 00:16:55.560
For my style is...

00:16:55.930 --> 00:16:56.510
