00:23:40.480 --> 00:23:43.810
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:44.410 --> 00:23:48.980
When you haven't heard from someone for years and you finally see them again,

00:23:49.420 --> 00:23:52.750
...you feel a little impatient and awkward.

00:23:53.320 --> 00:23:57.200
You think you have to say something, but you're too flustered to say anything at all.

00:23:58.020 --> 00:24:02.520
And then when it's suddenly time to part ways again and we mutter our farewells,

00:24:02.920 --> 00:24:09.330
...that's when I finally realize just how important that person has been to me.

